  "abstract_summary": "Agent memories keep derived artifacts (summaries, reflections, extracted facts), and those artifacts can outlive the sources a user deletes. We evaluate an input-keyed derived-memory design whose recorded dependencies are invalidated after source deletion, and ask whether serving its recomputed summaries improves an...",
